  "solution": "GIVEN:\n\n1(1)/(4) × ( 5(3)/(4) ÷ 2/7 of k ) ÷ 2(7)/(8) - 3(3)/(4) = (17 - 4) ÷ 2 of 2.\n\nFORMULA USED :\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/ZFoN-bAYshcZXA6Vkb6XBLuz3naCK2rCjL9VNMK5FBoQapzj_is-liVAq5wqRuaXx_QymC0xNQlXx7prnKQctl99GyCLVZRb4PniOSpj0WPQD11CQfzEtxz31CDKdXI4Y2NPzj1Xxxn5xaAeyPnKzvQ] \n\nCALCULATION**:** \n\n5/4 × ((23/4)/(2K/7)) ÷ 23/8 - 15/4 = 13/4 \n\n⇒ (15)/(4) × ((23)/(4) × (7)/(2k)) ÷ (23)/(8) - (15)/(4) = (13)/(4)\n\n⇒ (5)/(4) × (161)/(8k) × (8)/(23)-(15)/(4) =(13)/(4) \n\n⇒ (35)/(4k) = (15)/(4) +(13)/(4) \n\n⇒ (35)/(4k) = (28)/(4) \n\n⇒ k = (35)/(28) =(5)/(4) .\n\nNow, putting the value of k in (k + 1)/(k - 1)\n\n⇒ ((5)/(4) +1) /((5)/(4) -1) = (9)/(4) /(1)/(4) = (9)/(4) × 4 = 9.\n\nThe value of (k + 1)/(k - 1) = 9.",
